name: Wraith — rare joker spawn
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: Wraith Spectral creates a Rare Joker. Tight Ante 1 event: the spectral spawns a
  rare joker.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - wraith: [1]
should:
